farmersdelight.book.crop=Cultivation
farmersdelight.book.crop.main=This mod adds four new crops: Tomatoes, Onions, Cabbages, and Rice. These crops, along with vanilla crops, can generate as wild crops around the world.
farmersdelight.book.crop.tomatoes_title=§l§cTomatoes
farmersdelight.book.crop.tomatoes=§rTomatoes can be obtained by breaking tomato crops, breaking wild tomato shrubs, or cutting wild tomato shrubs on the cutting board. Tomato shrubs generate in hot biomes. When tomato crops have no linked rope above them, tomatoes will grow along the rope, reaching a maximum height of two blocks.
farmersdelight.book.crop.cabbages_title=§l§aCabbages
farmersdelight.book.crop.cabbages=§rCabbages can be obtained by breaking cabbage crops, breaking wild cabbages, or cutting wild cabbages on the cutting board. Wild cabbages generate in beach biomes.
farmersdelight.book.crop.onions_title=§l§6Onions
farmersdelight.book.crop.onions=§rOnions can be obtained by breaking onion crops, breaking wild onions, or cutting wild onions on the cutting board. Wild onions generate in temperate biomes.
farmersdelight.book.crop.rice_crop_title=§l§pRice
farmersdelight.book.crop.rice_crop=§rRice can be obtained by breaking rice crops, breaking wild rice, cutting rice panicles on the cutting board, or cutting wild rice on the cutting board. Wild rice generates in river biomes.
farmersdelight.book.back=Back

